        "node_id": "n_15_0b1c3c",
        "thought_text": "Implement a priority-based scheduling approach. Prioritize exams based on their deadlines and required preparation time. Schedule exams starting from the earliest deadline, ensuring that preparation days do not overlap with other exams or preparation periods.",
